{"quest":{"line_id":"11010536","line_type":"5","order":209,"title":{"cn":"求爱训练","en":"Courtship Lessons","jp":"愛の試練","kr":"프러포즈 시험"},"description":{"cn":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""},"reputation_camp_id":"102","reputation_camp_title":{"cn":"黑嚎氏族","en":"Grimmaw Clan","jp":"ブラックロアー","kr":"블랙하울 부족"},"route":"#/season-1/daily/11010536","assets":[{"asset_key":"optional/objective_11010536:1:1"},{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11236400"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_11010536:1:2"},{"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_11010536:1:2"},{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11236420"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_11010536:1:3"},{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11236430"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_11010536:1:4"},{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11236440"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_11010536:1:5"},{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11236450"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_11010536:1:6"},{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11236460"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_11010536:1:7"},{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11236470"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_11010536:1:8"},{"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_11010536:1:8"},{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11236480"}],"tasks":[{"task_id":"1","steps":[{"step_id":"1","pre_step_ids":[],"objective_title":{"cn":"与克鲁格对话","en":"Talk to Kruger","jp":"クルーガーと話す","kr":"크루거와 대화하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"黑嚎氏族里似乎出现了一些意外情况，向克鲁格询问一下是否需要帮助吧。","en":"Something unexpected seems to have cropped up within the Grimmaw Clan. Ask Kruger if he needs help.","jp":"ブラックロアーでアクシデントが起きたようだ。クルーガーに協力が必要か尋ねよう。","kr":"블랙하울 부족에 돌발 상황이 생긴 것 같다. 크루거에게 도움이 필요한지 물어보도록 하자."}},{"step_id":"2","pre_step_ids":["1"],"objective_title":{"cn":"帮助遇到困难的战士","en":"Help the Warrior","jp":"困っている戦士を助ける","kr":"어려움에 처한 전사 돕기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"黑嚎氏族的年轻人无法完成外族的求婚考验。向遇到困难的战士询问一下，看他需要什么样的帮助吧。","en":"A Grimmaw youth is having difficulty completing the test to marry someone outside the clan. Approach the distressed warrior and see if he needs help.","jp":"ブラックロアーの若者は、別の氏族からの求婚試練を達成できなかった。手伝えることがないか、困っている戦士に聞いてみよう。","kr":"블랙하울 부족의 젊은이가 외지인의 프러포즈 시험을 완료하기 어렵다고 한다. 어려움에 처한 전사들에게 어떤 도움이 필요한지 물어보도록 하자."}},{"step_id":"3","pre_step_ids":["2"],"objective_title":{"cn":"捕捉小蜥蜴","en":"Capture the Lizard","jp":"チビトカゲを捕まえる","kr":"작은 도마뱀 잡기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"捕捉沙漠中的小蜥蜴，给战士约阿比进行示范。","en":"Capture a small lizard in the sand as a demonstration for Abul.","jp":"砂漠でチビトカゲを捕まえて、戦士ヨアビに手本を示そう。","kr":"사막의 작은 도마뱀을 잡아 전사 요아비에게 시범을 보여주도록 하자."}},{"step_id":"4","pre_step_ids":["3"],"objective_title":{"cn":"帮助遇到困难的战士","en":"Help the Warrior","jp":"困っている戦士を助ける","kr":"어려움에 처한 전사 돕기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"前往乌尔氏族东边，帮助同样被求婚考验难住的战士奥波德。","en":"Head to the east side of the Uru Clan to help Abadal, a warrior who is also stumped by a marriage test.","jp":"ウール族の東部に行って、同じく求婚試練に手を焼いている戦士オポルドを助けよう。","kr":"우르 부족 동쪽으로 가 프러포즈 시험 때문에 어려움에 처한 전사 오보르드를 도와주도록 하자."}},{"step_id":"5","pre_step_ids":["4"],"objective_title":{"cn":"将陆行鸟幼崽赶回窝","en":"Guide the Terrabirds","jp":"雛を巣へと追い込む","kr":"어린 초코보를 둥지로 몰아넣기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"将陆行鸟幼崽赶回窝里，给战士奥波德进行示范。","en":"Guide the baby terrabirds back to their nest as a demonstration for Abadal.","jp":"バードマウントの雛を巣に連れ戻して、戦士オポルドに手本を示そう。","kr":"어린 초코보를 둥지로 몰아넣어 전사 오보르드에게 시범을 보여주도록 하자."}},{"step_id":"6","pre_step_ids":["5"],"objective_title":{"cn":"帮助遇到困难的战士","en":"Help the Warrior","jp":"困っている戦士を助ける","kr":"어려움에 처한 전사 돕기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"前往风蚀飞地的边陲驿站，帮助同样被求婚考验难住的黑嚎战士。","en":"Head to the frontier wayrest in the Eroded Enclave and help a Grimmaw warrior who is also stumped by a marriage test.","jp":"風食の飛地にある辺境の宿場へ行き、同じく求婚試練に手を焼いているブラックロアーの戦士を助けよう。","kr":"침식된 영토 변방의 역참으로 가서 프러포즈 시험 때문에 어려움에 처한 블랙하울 전사를 도와주도록 하자."}},{"step_id":"7","pre_step_ids":["6"],"objective_title":{"cn":"演示斗兽技巧","en":"Show Techniques","jp":"闘獣のコツを示す","kr":"맹수연기 기술 보여주기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"在战士提图斯面前示范如何斗兽，向他展示斗兽技巧。","en":"Show Titus how to battle these beasts.","jp":"戦士ティタスに、闘獣のコツを見せよう。","kr":"전사 티투스 앞에서 맹수연기 시범을 보이고, 그에게 맹수연기 기술을 보여주자."}},{"step_id":"8","pre_step_ids":["7"],"objective_title":{"cn":"与提图斯对话","en":"Talk to Titus","jp":"ティタスと話す","kr":"티투스와 대화하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"斗兽示范轻松完成，向战士提图斯询问一下是否还需要其他帮助吧。","en":"The demonstration is a breeze. Ask Titus if he needs help with anything else.","jp":"闘獣の手本は難なく見せられた。戦士ティタスに、他に力になれることがないか尋ねよう。","kr":"맹수연기 시범은 수월하게 끝났다. 전사 티투스에게 다른 도움이 필요한지 물어보도록 하자."}}]}],"archive_scope":"Configured faction daily paths. Live assignment, NPC visibility and minigame/battle success are not simulated.","source_plot_joins":[{"plot":"11236400","asset":"ep1/quest_story_11236400","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep1/quest_story_11236400.asset","raw_sha256":"5cc5364237ef07eaeeec9b4a18db9b0b90c62c3df099e0e07f70766976c39846","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":6268552,"size":1632,"identity":"11010536:1:1","field":"verified_npc_task_menu"},{"plot":"11236420","asset":"ep1/quest_story_11236420","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep1/quest_story_11236420.asset","raw_sha256":"ddf4f2a84339f6c95ba74cf5aa3e0220c835414a18bd9d52610c41ae44ceb574","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":6271072,"size":1544,"identity":"11010536:1:2","field":"verified_npc_task_menu"},{"plot":"11236430","asset":"ep1/quest_story_11236430","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep1/quest_story_11236430.asset","raw_sha256":"5da77bc99f2b9258c3fc6b6acd92db25a8d6358752d1b93092e9a8a9fd6a07cc","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":6272616,"size":1288,"identity":"11010536:1:3","field":"FinishAction"},{"plot":"11236440","asset":"ep1/quest_story_11236440","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep1/quest_story_11236440.asset","raw_sha256":"c569ae8b0cbe0879365761608df9b85e0c0e28c1ec7f32ab55055b4806d6b938","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":6273904,"size":1248,"identity":"11010536:1:4","field":"ClientFinishActionByMove"},{"plot":"11236450","asset":"ep1/quest_story_1123645